  ID: 6
  type: Addon
  nameMod: Soviet-Afgan War Addon V0.2
  des: 'This addon brings an immersive military experience to your Minecraft world
    by adding a wide range of weapons, gear, and a vehicle, all based on the historical
    context of the Soviet-Afghan War, which lasted from 1979 to 1989. Currently,
    the content focuses solely on the Soviet army, allowing players to step into
    the role of Soviet soldiers during this intense conflict. In its current version,
    the addon includes 10 different types of guns, each with unique designs and functions,
    providing various tactical options during gameplay. Additionally, it features
    8 distinct pieces of military equipment, such as helmets, body armor, and utility
    gear, that enhance both the visual appearance and survivability of your character.
    To complement these additions, the addon also introduces 1 functional military
    vehicle, which can be used for transport or combat support, and 2 types of medicine
    to help restore health and improve your chances of survival in the heat of battle. '
